Hello,

This message requests remailer configuration data. The pinging software thinks
yamn@mixmin.net is a remailer. Either it has been told so by the
maintainer of the pinger or it found the address in a remailer-conf or
remailer-key reply of some other remailer.

If this is _not_ a remailer, you can tell this pinger that and it will stop
sending you those requests immediately (otherwise it will try a few more times).
Just reply and make sure the following is the first line of your message:
	not a remailer

If you want to talk to a human please mail remops@pinger.example.org.
